{
  "dataset": {
    "n_rows": 6927,
    "version": "1.0",
    "description": "Single-session online skills assessment -- self-report scales plus timed cognitive and behavioural tasks -- bracketed by a pre-assessment and a post-assessment survey, with a feedback-arm randomisation in a 1229-person subsample and a 6-month tracer follow-up in 471 of those. One row per individual job seeker in southern Africa; among the 38.8% with a country recorded, 80.4% are in South Africa, 9.7% in Lesotho and 5.4% in Nigeria. Monetary amounts are monthly ZAR (South African rand) unless stated."
  },
